crazy when you think about that,

7
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.610
because you're like, well,
what is restoration and to be made

8
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.970
new? Well, they're happening
at the same time, right?

9
00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.690
Faith in Jesus is what initiates
this restoration of our

10
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:29.170
